        "id": 2039159
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-07T19:36:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The identity to pseudo random function is needed as we chose to store the Encrypted Data Key Material within the bt_config.conf file in order to have access to the value in between booting the device. Since the value is stored under the pseudo random address we need that address in order to retrieve the encrypted data key material to decrypt.",
      "parentUuid": "0a5214ea_7c246822",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 61,
        "startChar": 19,
